%N A220791 Number of nonsingular n X n matrices over GF(13).
%H A220791 Vincenzo Librandi, <a href="/A220791/b220791.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..30</a>
%H A220791 Jeffrey Overbey, William Traves, and Jerzy Wojdylo, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1080/0161-110591893771">On the Keyspace of the Hill Cipher</a>, Cryptologia, Vol. 29, No. 1 (2005), pp. 59-72; <a href="http://jeff.over.bz/papers/undergrad/on-the-keyspace-of-the-hill-cipher.pdf">alternative link</a>.
%F A220791 a(n) ~ c * 13^(n^2), where c = Product_{k>=1} (1-1/13^k) = 0.917162472540941572903... . - _Amiram Eldar_, Sep 26 2026
%t A220791 Table[Product[13^n - 13^k, {k, 0, n-1}], {n, 0, 8}]
%o A220791 (Magma) [1] cat [&*[(13^n - 13^k): k in [0..n-1]]: n in [1..8]];
%Y A220791 Column k=13 of A316622.
